     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.TechnicalOfficer.html\">Technical Officer</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"L1REV-01\"> </a></b>Identify source documents</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify and locate relevant WHO guidelines, normative products, and associated publications for a given health area.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L1REV-02\"> </a></b>Extract health interventions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can extract health interventions from the UHC menu of interventions and digital health interventions from the WHO classification.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L1REV-03\"> </a></b>Identify clinical recommendations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify and interpret clinical recommendations embedded in L1 source documents.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L1REV-04\"> </a></b>Assess guideline currency</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether guidelines are recently updated and identify forward-looking system requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"L1REV-05\"> </a></b>Verify L2 coverage of L1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that L2 DAK components accurately reflect and cover the L1 recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent aux acteurs suivants : </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ClinicalSME.html\">Clinical Subject Matter Expert</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.TechnicalOfficer.html\">Technical Officer</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L1REV-01\"> </a></b>Identify source documents</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify and locate relevant WHO guidelines, normative products, and associated publications for a given health area.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L1REV-02\"> </a></b>Extract health interventions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can extract health interventions from the UHC menu of interventions and digital health interventions from the WHO classification.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L1REV-03\"> </a></b>Identify clinical recommendations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can identify and interpret clinical recommendations embedded in L1 source documents.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L1REV-04\"> </a></b>Assess guideline currency</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether guidelines are recently updated and identify forward-looking system requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-L1REV-05\"> </a></b>Verify L2 coverage of L1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that L2 DAK components accurately reflect and cover the L1 recommendations.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewL1Guidelines\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; marg